@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN
@verificationUrl = REPLACE_WITH_SIGNED_VERIFICATION_URL

### Verification status
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/email/verification-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Send verification notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/email/verification-notification
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Verify email by signed URL
GET {{verificationUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### Auth case missing token, expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/email/verification-status
Accept: application/json
